50. 181.9500000000000455 Td
(1. "ISRC format is invalid": Make sure your ISRC has 12 alphanumeric characters \(e.g. QZK6L2400001\). Hyphens and spaces) Tj
T* (are stripped automatically.) Tj
T* (2. "Cover artwork must be 3000x3000": Both the Single/Album form and Bulk Import automatically resize any JPG/PNG from) Tj
T* (DistroKid Vault to 3000x3000 px RGB.) Tj
T* (3. "Master audio must be WAV or FLAC": DistriBeats requires uncompressed/lossless masters. Do not upload MP3 files.) Tj
